{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":958277,\"title\":\"The Biggest Little Ticket\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"This one-hour children's television special is the story of a young girl who slips into an enchanted world of trolls and dragons and finds herself on stage in a magic theatre during a performance by some of the biggest names in children's entertainment: Robert Munsch, Fred Penner and Rockapella.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8hNdqARhQAEyfFRQcZUMDLDEmUG.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":1994,\"runtime\":60,\"genres\":[\"TV Movie\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"CA\",\"name\":\"Canada\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Robert Lang\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":2800898,\"name\":\"Robert Lang\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2366040,\"name\":\"Robert N. Munsch\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1249973,\"name\":\"Fred Penner\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6qOqNavX9OM7oFsySaxI8NR3vHs.jpg\"},{\"id\":2615796,\"name\":\"Rockapella\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":29384,\"name\":\"Sheila McCarthy\",\"character\":\"The Troll\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wIe1srcx1lllkE66Jx5j9mV2BEc.jpg\"},{\"id\":1233025,\"name\":\"Asia Vieira\",\"character\":\"Glenda\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/paxmYJuQCO5ZaV8ztNZuOJMDTO8.jpg\"},{\"id\":185102,\"name\":\"Jackie Richardson\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jIDfdGW26RixUhewLXskCQAoCl8.jpg\"},{\"id\":3492170,\"name\":\"Bob Stutt\",\"character\":\"Iggy Iguana\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":3492199,\"name\":\"Dario Dominques\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1239408,\"name\":\"Ron Stefaniuk\",\"character\":\"The Dragon\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2800898,\"name\":\"Robert Lang\",\"character\":\"The Dragon (voice)\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1318621,\"title\":\"Descendants: Wicked Wonderland\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xdhLAADGSse8KCrsDLBuM5b68Cg.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qlfqDJ9Piv5ufzYA8j2319mwKZU.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Now that the Queen of Hearts is nice and Cinderella is safe, things seem perfect for Red and Chloe… But little do they know that changing the past created a new villain — Maddox Hatter. When Maddox captures the Queen of Hearts, Red and Chloe must work alongside Red’s new sister Pink, Luisa Madrigal’s son Luis, and Maddox’s son Max to save her and Wonderland.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"TV Movie\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1243341,\"title\":\"Z-O-M-B-I-E-S 4: Dawn of the Vampires\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6rGsqBxI4r1YkS9FuraovWi465w.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/68TGPnvmZ21NBOoV5IUZ4fQDyvZ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A new adventure dawns for Zed and Addison when their summer road trip takes an unexpected detour, landing them in the middle of yet another monster rivalry: Daywalkers vs. Vampires. Tensions flare when Zed and Addison find themselves acting as camp counselors between the two opposing supernatural factions. With the help of Eliza and Willa, they must convince sworn enemies Nova and Victor to try to unite their warring worlds before an even greater threat endangers them all.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Music\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":537061,\"title\":\"Steven Universe: The Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8mRgpubxHqnqvENK4Bei30xMDvy.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/re3ZvlKJg04iLpLRf1xTKHS2wLU.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Two years after bringing peace to the galaxy, Steven Universe sees his past come back to haunt him in the form of a deranged Gem who wants to destroy the Earth.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":26736,\"title\":\"Wizards of Waverly Place: The Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vrjLcGBLurVem5lXN8237qz4tyE.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9Qvc6fzE3PzodgJ9no11GlLYZJF.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"During a family vacation, Alex, a young witch, accidentally casts a curse on her loved ones. To reverse this, she tries to find a magical stone while her brother tries to keep their parents together.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"TV Movie\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":21481,\"title\":\"Twitches\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8ctDK5B0uR2gre2PxQSSkJZFmh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cu00bZ1hg3Zw9lfDdtMFtvqDTzF.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Twins separated at birth, Camryn and Alex meet by chance for the first time on their 21st birthday and discover they're witches with the power to save their homeland of Coventry from the evil that threatens it. But when Camryn leaves Alex to face the darkness alone, will Coventry be doomed? Or will the sisters multiply their magic by standing together?\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":671583,\"title\":\"Upside-Down Magic\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/r2MfnMmFzGvRvjGVLIuyx3R16a6.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1SZuV2Qp1RD13MhdTdqTGBVhcyc.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Nory and her best friend Reina enter the Sage Academy for Magical Studies, where Nory’s unconventional powers land her in a class for those with wonky, or “upside-down,” magic. Undaunted, Nory sets out to prove that that upside-down magic can be just as powerful as right-side-up.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Family\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":92208,\"title\":\"Mom's Got a Date with a Vampire\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2c7oXpT7y0Rtwko7vm73zWKyLUn.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oJe5xph6PxARGmEAYpuf06fFw45.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The Hansen kids are in a jam. Adam and his best friend Duffy have gotten their hands on some tickets for the Headless Horseman concert, and his sister Chelsea has a date with her dreamy boyfriend Peter. The only problem is they're both grounded. Chelsea and Adam will do whatever it takes to get their mom Lynette out of the house, even if it includes a chance meeting with a very mysterious man. Everything seems to go according to plan until their little brother Taylor realizes that this stranger might be a vampire.\",\"genres\":[\"TV Movie\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":50393,\"title\":\"Kung Fu Panda Holiday\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vJv3pI8pyS13rLjy0ok7a3BiE0a.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cMR6Mpo8N6JVKbEuxet6N0p1NMA.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The Winter Feast is Po's favorite holiday. Every year he and his father hang decorations, cook together, and serve noodle soup to the villagers. But this year Shifu informs Po that as Dragon Warrior, it is his duty to host the formal Winter Feast at the Jade Palace. Po is caught between his obligations as the Dragon Warrior and his family traditions: between Shifu and Mr. Ping.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"DEteBFRmOGA\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"DFyy-1vT5yY\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"-u1ae7b3_bA\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}